<template><div class="login-page"><div class="login-panel"><div class="login-brand"><div class="join-mark">JOIN<br/><span>COM</span></div><div><h1>聚客联盟</h1><p>JOINCOM × CMHK 业务管理后台</p></div></div><div class="login-copy"><span>OPERATIONS CONSOLE</span><h2>让每一张卡、每一笔订单<br/>都有清晰去向。</h2><p>统一管理 ICCID、客户、订单、甲方对账与二级渠道结算。</p></div><small>仅限获授权的内部工作人员使用</small></div><div class="login-form"><div class="form-box"><p class="eyebrow">ADMIN SIGN IN</p><h2>管理员登录</h2><p class="subtitle">输入管理账号，进入业务工作台。</p><el-form :model="form" label-position="top" @submit.prevent="submit"><el-form-item label="账号"><el-input v-model="form.username" size="large" autocomplete="username"/></el-form-item><el-form-item label="密码"><el-input v-model="form.password" size="large" type="password" show-password autocomplete="current-password" @keyup.enter="submit"/></el-form-item><el-button type="primary" size="large" :loading="loading" class="login-button" @click="submit">登录管理后台</el-button></el-form><div class="privacy">后台不接收身份证件、地址证明或其他正式身份文件。</div></div></div></div></template>
